      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-161997\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-161997\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">The minimum size of a fixture supply pipe shall be as shown in <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\"><Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-161996', hash: '#JD_PCTable604.5' }}\">Table 604.5<\/Link><\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">. The fixture supply pipe shall terminate not more than 24 inches (610 mm) from the point of connection to the fixture. Each fixture supply shall have a stop valve. A reduced-size flexible water connector installed between the supply pipe and the fixture shall be of an approved<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">&#160;<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">type. The connector shall be used singularly. Coupling of two or more connectors shall not be allowed. The supply pipe shall extend to the floor or wall adjacent to the fixture. The minimum size of individual distribution lines utilized in parallel water distribution systems shall be as shown in <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\"><Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-161996', hash: '#JD_PCTable604.5' }}\">Table 604.5<\/Link><\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">.<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-161998\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-161998\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><a name=\"JD_PCTable604.5\" id=\"JD_PCTable604.5\" title=\"PC Table 604.5\"><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Table 604.5<br><\/br>Minimum Sizes of Fixture Water Supply Pipes<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-161999\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-161999\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div>",
